Harbor Plumbing · Austin Emergency plumber in Austin: what to do in the first hour If water is spreading, shut off the main valve first. In most Austin homes it sits where the water line enters the house. 1. Stop the water 2. Turn off the water heater 3. Call, and say what you see	sample data
